gakY(){return"How are you? What\u2019s new? | Tell me, how are things there? | We haven\u2019t talked in a while. Anything new?"},
gakX(){return"Give me some advice about work | I need advice. What would you do in my place? | Any tips on how to handle business?"},
gal1(){return"Nothing to brag about yet, but I\u2019m trying! | No deals yet, but they\u2019re coming"},
akZ(a,b){return"Sold the "+a+" and made "+b+"! | Closed a deal: "+a+", "+b+" on top | Guess who sold a "+a+" with "+b+" profit?"},
