gaxU(){return"Transport takes you between cities. Compare train, plane and your own car: travel costs money and time, and your car can break down on the way."},
gaxq(){return"P-Bank holds your money and spending history. Recolor your card; premium cards give cashback on travel, parking and repairs. Savings and car insurance live here too."},
gaxK(){return"PlameFinance offers loans and microloans. Borrow only if you know how you\u2019ll earn it back: missed payments bring bailiffs. Broke? Check Subsidies."},
